src/entities_data.rs contains the WHATWG HTML
named character reference table, retrieved 2026-09-11 from:
https://html.spec.whatwg.org/entities.json

The table is generated by tools/generate_rust_entities.py from the existing
TypeScript data. The table was reduced to entity names (without the leading ampersand) and their
character values. No Python standard-library code or tables are included.

